    "ja": "メリー・ウィッチーズ・ライフ　～ベルルバジルの3人の未亡人～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Merry Witches’ Life: The Three Widows of Berlebagille"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "**A quirky and unexpected manga series exploring themes of grief and friendship in a heart-warming, light-hearted fantasy setting with plenty of humor, Merry Witches Life is a story about three women determined to learn magic and be the agents of their own happiness!**\n \nZoe, Shishka, and Eliza have very little in common. Zoe is a failed witch from a mysterious magical island, Shishka is Zoe’s best friend from long ago, and Eliza is… well, a scarab beetle. However, the three of them do share something important: they are all widows, and none of them are willing to give up on their beloveds!\n\nFrom spells that go hilariously wrong, to uncovering the secrets of their new country home, this story of romance and friendship is truly magical.\n\n(Source: TOKYOPOP)"
  },
